WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.150
Have you ever wondered about the secret desire
of SCP-166, Just A Teenage Gaea?

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:11.070
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-166 from

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.270
twenty meters away, while she was praying
in her cell.

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.570
This was the result:

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.769
"Roaming a field of wildflowers, catching
cicadas with a bug net.

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:25.349
SCP-166 is accompanied by an older male with
similar ungulate features to itself."

00:00:25.349 --> 00:00:30.310
It seems that she just wants to live a peaceful,
simple life in nature, where no one will bother

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.520
her or trouble her again.

